  "model_convention": "A model entry names an exact finite SCM built by tests/python/test_counterfactual_calculus.py. Kind generic is a seeded independent-root model from tests/python/calculus_oracles.py with binary domains unless domains says otherwise; a vertex has all its response tables when they number at most max_tables (default 16), and otherwise that many seeded tables. Every model that witnesses a dependence is asserted strictly positive in its observational law and every hard-intervention kernel.",
